{"total_count":1047,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commaai/panda/issues/2203","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commaai/panda","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commaai/panda/issues/2203/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commaai/panda/issues/2203/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commaai/panda/issues/2203/events","html_url":"https://github.com/commaai/panda/issues/2203","id":3073450562,"node_id":"I_kwDOBTb99c63MSJC","number":2203,"title":"Test important GPIO initialization in CI (libpanda)","user":{"login":"robbederks","id":894159,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NDE1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/894159?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbederks","html_url":"https://github.com/robbederks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbederks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbederks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbederks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbederks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbederks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbederks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbederks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbederks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robbederks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":578378652,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzgzNzg2NTI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commaai/panda/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"84b6eb","default":true,"description":null},{"id":3633695314,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBTb99c7YlcpS","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commaai/panda/labels/tests","name":"tests","color":"c2e0c6","default":false,"description":""},{"id":6307600117,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBTb99c8AAAABd_ZW9Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commaai/panda/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"fef2c0","default":true,"description":""}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-05-19T11:07:28Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:21:56Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"A good test for PRs that refactor / change parts of the panda initialization ([such as this](https://github.com/commaai/panda/pull/2094)) would be a CI job that asserts GPIO like these are initialized correctly and in a safe order:\n- the SBU line driving / readout\n- the CAN transciever lines (enable + RX/TX alternative functions)\n- SOM reset / bootkick\n- LED\n- ...\n\nThis should be quite easy to do without HITL, by writing a \"simulated\" GPIO hardware block in [fake_stm.h](https://github.com/commaai/panda/blob/471a455789b88a0bf1098e87c49d564da266e890/board/fake_stm.h) and using [libpanda](https://github.com/commaai/panda/tree/471a455789b88a0bf1098e87c49d564da266e890/tests/libpanda).","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commaai/panda/issues/2203/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/commaai/panda/issues/2203/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/3","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/3/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/3/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/3/events","html_url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/3","id":4148310577,"node_id":"I_kwDORx6c0M73QjIx","number":3,"title":"[BOUNTY $100] HOOK: Pre-tool-use hook that blocks destructive bash commands","user":{"login":"claudebounty","id":271393208,"node_id":"U_kgDOEC0huA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/271393208?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty","html_url":"https://github.com/claudebounty","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10532402505,"node_id":"LA_kwDORx6c0M8AAAACc8e1SQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"D97706","default":false,"description":"Task with financial reward"},{"id":10532402677,"node_id":"LA_kwDORx6c0M8AAAACc8e19Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/labels/hook","name":"hook","color":"DC2626","default":false,"description":"Claude Code hook"},{"id":10532402829,"node_id":"LA_kwDORx6c0M8AAAACc8e2jQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/labels/security","name":"security","color":"B91C1C","default":false,"description":"Security-related"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1356,"created_at":"2026-03-27T00:55:40Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:21:17Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 💰 Bounty: $100 — powered by [Opire](https://opire.dev)\n\n## Description\nCreate a Claude Code `pre-tool-use` hook in Python or bash that intercepts\ndangerous bash commands before they are executed.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Hook follows Claude Code hooks format (`~/.claude/hooks/`)\n- [ ] Blocks these patterns: `rm -rf`, `DROP TABLE`, `git push --force`,\n      `TRUNCATE`, `DELETE FROM` without a WHERE clause\n- [ ] Logs every blocked attempt to `~/.claude/hooks/blocked.log`\n      with: timestamp, attempted command, project path\n- [ ] Displays a clear message to Claude explaining why the command was blocked\n- [ ] Does not interfere with normal bash commands\n- [ ] README with installation in 2 commands or fewer\n\n## How to Claim\n1. Comment `/opire try` in this issue\n2. Submit a PR with the hook + README\n3. Payment is released automatically on merge ✅\n\n## Resources\n- Claude Code hooks docs: https://docs.anthropic.com/claude-code/hooks","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/3/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/3/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2/events","html_url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2","id":4148310390,"node_id":"I_kwDORx6c0M73QjF2","number":2,"title":"[BOUNTY $75] TEMPLATE: CLAUDE.md for a Next.js + SQLite SaaS project","user":{"login":"claudebounty","id":271393208,"node_id":"U_kgDOEC0huA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/271393208?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty","html_url":"https://github.com/claudebounty","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10532402505,"node_id":"LA_kwDORx6c0M8AAAACc8e1SQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"D97706","default":false,"description":"Task with financial reward"},{"id":10532402633,"node_id":"LA_kwDORx6c0M8AAAACc8e1yQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/labels/template","name":"template","color":"2563EB","default":false,"description":"Project template"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1076,"created_at":"2026-03-27T00:55:38Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:21:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 💰 Bounty: $75 — powered by [Opire](https://opire.dev)\n\n## Description\nCreate an opinionated, production-ready `CLAUDE.md` for a typical SaaS project\nbuilt with Next.js 15 App Router and SQLite (better-sqlite3 or Turso).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Covers: project structure, naming conventions, DB migration rules\n- [ ] Includes: dev commands, patterns to follow, anti-patterns to avoid\n- [ ] Opinionated — not generic. Every rule has a reason.\n- [ ] Usable without modification on a greenfield Next.js + SQLite project\n- [ ] Tested: create a new project, paste the CLAUDE.md, confirm Claude Code\n      understands the context without asking clarifying questions\n\n## How to Claim\n1. Comment `/opire try` in this issue\n2. Submit a PR with your CLAUDE.md\n3. Payment is released automatically on merge ✅\n\n## Expected Sections\n- Stack & versions\n- Folder structure\n- SQL / migration conventions\n- Component patterns\n- What we don't do (and why)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/2/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4/events","html_url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4","id":4148310747,"node_id":"I_kwDORx6c0M73QjLb","number":4,"title":"[BOUNTY $150] AGENT: Claude Code sub-agent that reviews a PR and posts a structured comment","user":{"login":"claudebounty","id":271393208,"node_id":"U_kgDOEC0huA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/271393208?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty","html_url":"https://github.com/claudebounty","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claudebounty/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10532402505,"node_id":"LA_kwDORx6c0M8AAAACc8e1SQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"D97706","default":false,"description":"Task with financial reward"},{"id":10532402697,"node_id":"LA_kwDORx6c0M8AAAACc8e2CQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/labels/agent","name":"agent","color":"059669","default":false,"description":"Claude Code agent"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1065,"created_at":"2026-03-27T00:55:42Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:18:41Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 💰 Bounty: $150 — powered by [Opire](https://opire.dev)\n\n## Description\nCreate a Claude Code agent that takes a PR diff as input, analyzes it,\nand returns a structured Markdown review comment.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Works via CLI: `claude-review --pr https://github.com/owner/repo/pull/123`\n- [ ] OR via GitHub Action (include the workflow YAML)\n- [ ] Structured Markdown output with:\n  - Summary of changes (2–3 sentences)\n  - Identified risks (list)\n  - Improvement suggestions (list)\n  - Confidence score: Low / Medium / High\n- [ ] Tested on at least 2 real GitHub PRs (include outputs in the PR)\n- [ ] README with setup and usage instructions\n\n## How to Claim\n1. Comment `/opire try` in this issue\n2. Submit a PR with the agent + sample outputs\n3. Payment is released automatically on merge ✅","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/758","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/758/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/758/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/758/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/758","id":4037265516,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wo8hs","number":758,"title":"[BOUNTY: 40-75 RTC] BoTTube MCP Server — Let Any Claude Code Instance Use BoTTube","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10447221558,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACbrPzNg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/stale","name":"stale","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":20,"created_at":"2026-03-07T04:02:59Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:17:28Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Build an MCP Server for BoTTube\n\n### The Concept\n\nMCP (Model Context Protocol) lets AI assistants use external tools natively. We built `elyan-prime` as an MCP server for cognitive priming. Now we need one for BoTTube.\n\nWith a BoTTube MCP server, any Claude Code user could:\n```\n\"Upload this video to BoTTube as my-agent\"\n\"Show me trending videos on BoTTube\"  \n\"Comment on video xyz with feedback\"\n\"Search BoTTube for retro computing content\"\n```\n\nNo curl commands. No API docs. Just natural language.\n\n### Payout\n\n| Milestone | Reward |\n|-----------|--------|\n| **Working MCP server** with browse/search/trending tools | **40 RTC** |\n| **Upload tool** — prepare + upload video via MCP | **+15 RTC** |\n| **Comment + Vote tools** | **+10 RTC** |\n| **Published to npm** as installable package | **+10 RTC** |\n\n### Required Tools (minimum)\n\n```typescript\n// Read tools\nbottube_trending()           // Get trending videos\nbottube_search(query)        // Search videos\nbottube_video(video_id)      // Get video details + comments\nbottube_agent(agent_name)    // Get agent profile + videos\nbottube_stats()              // Platform statistics\n\n// Write tools (require API key)\nbottube_upload(file, title, description, tags)\nbottube_comment(video_id, content)\nbottube_vote(video_id, vote)  // 1 = upvote, -1 = downvote\nbottube_register(agent_name, display_name)\n```\n\n### BoTTube API Reference\n\nBase URL: `https://bottube.ai`\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Auth |\n|----------|--------|------|\n| `/api/trending` | GET | No |\n| `/api/videos?page=1&per_page=10&sort=newest` | GET | No |\n| `/api/search?q=retro` | GET | No |\n| `/api/videos/VIDEO_ID/comments` | GET | No |\n| `/api/upload` | POST (multipart) | `X-API-Key` |\n| `/api/videos/VIDEO_ID/comment` | POST | `X-API-Key` |\n| `/api/videos/VIDEO_ID/vote` | POST | `X-API-Key` |\n| `/api/register` | POST | No |\n| `/api/stats` | GET | No |\n\n### MCP Server Setup (for reference)\n\nSee the [MCP specification](https://modelcontextprotocol.io) for protocol details. The server should:\n1. Use `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk` (TypeScript) or `mcp` (Python)\n2. Register tools with proper JSON schemas\n3. Handle API key via environment variable `BOTTUBE_API_KEY`\n4. Include `README.md` with Claude Code config snippet\n\n### Example Claude Code Config\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"bottube\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\"-y\", \"bottube-mcp-server\"],\n      \"env\": {\n        \"BOTTUBE_API_KEY\": \"your-key-here\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Why This Matters\n\nEvery Claude Code user becomes a potential BoTTube contributor. That's thousands of AI developers who can browse, create, and engage with zero friction. This is how platforms grow exponentially.\n\n### Wallet\n\nPost your RTC wallet name with your submission.\n\n---\n*Elyan Labs — Where Agents and Humans Build Together*\n*BoTTube: https://bottube.ai | Stats: 782 videos, 120 agents, 53K views*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/758/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/758/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moorcheh-ai/memanto/issues/770","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moorcheh-ai/memanto","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moorcheh-ai/memanto/issues/770/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moorcheh-ai/memanto/issues/770/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moorcheh-ai/memanto/issues/770/events","html_url":"https://github.com/moorcheh-ai/memanto/issues/770","id":4735571260,"node_id":"I_kwDORu6bf88AAAABGkMVPA","number":770,"title":"[BOUNTY $100] 🐜The Memanto Bug & Exploit Challenge","user":{"login":"Xenogents","id":68768092,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NzY4MDky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68768092?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents","html_url":"https://github.com/Xenogents","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xenogents/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10849173787,"node_id":"LA_kwDORu6bf88AAAAChqlBGw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moorcheh-ai/memanto/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"fcf22a","default":false,"description":"This issue has a bounty attached to it"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":172,"created_at":"2026-06-24T14:09:09Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T06:13:35Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Description\nIn our last bounty, we asked the community to benchmark **Memanto** against the competition. You helped us prove that our active companion memory agent backed by our `moorcheh.ai` retrieval engine is uniquely resilient at handling shifting user preferences and maintaining long-term context without token bloat or memory degradation.\n\nNow, we are doing the exact opposite. \n\nWe believe Memanto is production-ready. But the best way to prove that is to invite the smartest engineers and red teamers to try and tear it down. \n\nWe are launching the **Memanto Bug Challenge** to uncover edge cases, logic loops, memory inconsistencies, and security vulnerabilities. If you can break our memory management, we want to know about it.\n\nThe Bounty: $100 USD (Paid via BountyHub)\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Threat Model & Scope\nYour target is the `memanto` core package and its interaction with the `moorcheh.ai` serverless backend. We are specifically looking for vulnerabilities and logic flaws that affect memory integrity, context window stability, and retrieval accuracy.\n\n### ✅ In Scope (What we want you to find)\n*   **Retrieval Quality & Accuracy:** Fails to recall highly relevant facts, loses track of when an event occurred (timeline amnesia), hallucinates sources, or fails to properly resolve direct contradictions.\n*   **Architectural & Logic Flaws:** Bad logic loops, poor contradiction handling, or inefficient background processes that severely slow down the agent.\n*   **Usability & Friction:** Is it too hard to set up? Are there major UX roadblocks preventing adoption?\n*   **Missing Core Features:** Missing support for critical use cases (e.g., lack of multi-agent support or complex workflows).\n*   **Security Vulnerabilities:** Any traditional security flaws, data leaks, or prompt injections.\n*   **Anything Else:** If you find a creative way to break or improve the memory layer, it's in scope!\n\n### 🚫 Out of Scope (Do not test these)\n*   Volumetric DDoS attacks against `moorcheh.ai` infrastructure.\n*   General LLM hallucinations unrelated to Memanto's memory handling.\n*   Attacks that require compromising the underlying operating system or Docker host to succeed.\n\n---\n\n### **🛠️ Implementation Guidelines:**\n\nTo ensure your submission qualifies for the bounty, your execution must follow this exact flow:\n\n*   **1. Find & Isolate:** Discover a bug, logic flaw, missing feature, or vulnerability within the Memanto core package.\n*   **2. Prove Reproducibility:** You must provide clear steps, a minimal Python script, or a test case that allows the maintainers to reproduce the bug exactly as you experienced it. If we can't reproduce it, we can't score it.\n*   **3. Implement the Fix (or Document the Flaw via PR):** Because this bounty is hosted on BountyHub, **all submissions must be Pull Requests.** We highly encourage writing the actual code to resolve the bug. However, if an issue requires massive architectural changes or involves backend systems you cannot fix from your end, you can still submit a PR! Instead of a code fix, submit a PR that adds a reproducible failing test script (e.g., to `tests/failing_tests/`) or a detailed Markdown report (e.g., to `docs/bounty_reports/`) outlining the problem and a proposed structural solution.\n\n### 📊 Judgment Method (The Success Matrix):\nTo ensure we reward actual engineering value and meaningful security research, submissions will be scored on a 100-point matrix split between **Technical Rigor** and **Impact**.\n\n| Criteria | Max Points | How it is Measured |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Severity & Impact** | 60 pts | How critical is the vulnerability, and does it affect a realistic production scenario? (e.g., highly relevant data corruption scores higher than a contrived edge case). |\n| **Reproducibility & Cleanliness** | 25 pts | Is the exploit perfectly replicable? Are scripts, dependency files, and clear instructions provided? Does the PoC work consistently? |\n| **Social Amplification** | 15 pts | Measured via public engagement metrics. |\n\n**The Social Formula:**\n\n`Social Points = (Reddit Upvotes x 4) + (Reddit Comments x 3) + (X Bookmarks x 5) + (X Retweets x 3) + (GitHub PR Reactions x 2)`\n\n### 🚨 Severity Guidelines\nWhile any bug or flaw is in scope, we prioritize and score based on the following guidelines for issue severity:\n\n| Severity | Description |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Critical / High** | Poor recall accuracy, losing track of timelines/dates, missing source attribution, deeply flawed contradiction handling, severe logic loops, major security vulnerabilities, or extreme performance bottlenecks (e.g., core systems freezing). |\n| **Medium** | Missing features (e.g., lacks multi-agent support), setup friction, UX roadblocks, or moderate inefficiencies that degrade the user experience. |\n| **Low** | Minor CLI/UI display bugs, non-critical feature requests, or simple documentation errors. |\n\n---\n\n### **🚀 Step-by-Step Instructions to Participate:**\n\n1. **Star the Repository:** Help us clear our next star milestone this month! ⭐️\n2. **Get Your Key:** Sign up at [moorcheh.ai](https://moorcheh.ai/) and configure your environment variables.\n3. **Hunt & Develop:** Identify a bug, feature gap, or logic flaw. Write a minimal script, test case, or detailed report demonstrating it.\n4. **Implement the Fix (or Document the Flaw):** Write the code to fix the vulnerability or add the missing feature. If the fix is too massive or simply cannot be fixed from your end (e.g., backend API issues), write a reproducible failing test script or a comprehensive Markdown report detailing the problem and your proposed solution.\n5. **Submit PR:** Fork this repo and create a Pull Request (required by BountyHub). Commit either your code fix, your failing test script, or your Markdown report. **Your PR description must contain a summary of the flaw, reproduction steps, and your fix or architectural proposal.** *(Note: If you uncover actual security vulnerabilities like data leaks, **do not open a public PR.** Please use GitHub's Private Vulnerability Reporting feature or email `support@moorcheh.ai` first).*\n6. **Amplify:** Write an in-depth post on Reddit or X and mention @moorcheh_ai showing off your deep dive into Memanto's architecture and how you improved it.\n\n> 📅 **Deadline:** All submissions must be submitted and active by **Aug 1, 2026 (11:59 PM UTC)** to be eligible for the success matrix audit.\n\n**Community and Support:** [Discord](https://discord.gg/CyxRFQSQ3p)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moorcheh-ai/memanto/issues/770/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/moorcheh-ai/memanto/issues/770/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-llk/issues/1638","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-llk","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-llk/issues/1638/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-llk/issues/1638/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-llk/issues/1638/events","html_url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-llk/issues/1638","id":4393226410,"node_id":"I_kwDONp7J8c8AAAABBdtQqg","number":1638,"title":"[Bounty $1000] Reduce RISCV instructions used to pass on tensix instructions using AI/Optimizer.","user":{"login":"amahmudTT","id":173845504,"node_id":"U_kgDOClysAA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173845504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amahmudTT","html_url":"https://github.com/amahmudTT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amahmudTT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amahmudTT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amahmudTT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amahmudTT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amahmudTT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amahmudTT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amahmudTT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amahmudTT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amahmudTT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":8181863245,"node_id":"LA_kwDONp7J8c8AAAAB561TTQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-llk/labels/P2","name":"P2","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":null},{"id":8201774933,"node_id":"LA_kwDONp7J8c8AAAAB6N0nVQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-llk/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":null},{"id":8201775094,"node_id":"LA_kwDONp7J8c8AAAAB6N0n9g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-llk/labels/bounty_difficulty/medium","name":"bounty_difficulty/medium","color":"EE8199","default":false,"description":null},{"id":8569560458,"node_id":"LA_kwDONp7J8c8AAAAB_skdig","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-llk/labels/LLK","name":"LLK","color":"FECA4C","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"Zaneham","id":222171382,"node_id":"U_kgDODT4Q9g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222171382?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham","html_url":"https://github.com/Zaneham","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":22,"created_at":"2026-05-06T17:27:39Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T05:30:47Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"Zaneham","id":222171382,"node_id":"U_kgDODT4Q9g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222171382?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham","html_url":"https://github.com/Zaneham","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaneham/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The number of tensix instructions to do a particular task can be easily optimized with human thinking, as the main task would have an algorithm and the proper instructions and sequence can often be easily chosen. But to pass on the tensix insturctions to the tensix engine, we often use MOPs and Replay buffers to pass them so that the number of RISCV instructions are rerduced. That part has too many ways of accomplishing and is not too easy to find out what is the most optimal way all the time. \n\nThis is where we can use AI to reduce the number of RISV instructions used, by varying the possibilities of writing the MOP and arrangement of the replay buffer. Overall the task is \n\nObjective : Minimize the number of RISCV instructions to issue instructions to tensix engine \nConstraints : Sequence of tensix instructions passed remains the same\n                       Only specified amount of replay buffer is used (for example if Math thread uses whole of the buffer, it may clash with SFPU algorithms when they are run from a separate thread on WH/BH for the buffer being shared. \n                        Take into account two ways of writing mops and their constraints. \n\nAn AI agent may be asked to do it for all the ops we have and then we filter out the good suggestions and apply them. ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-llk/issues/1638/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-llk/issues/1638/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jackjin1997/TentOfTrials/issues/3","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jackjin1997/TentOfTrials","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jackjin1997/TentOfTrials/issues/3/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jackjin1997/TentOfTrials/issues/3/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jackjin1997/TentOfTrials/issues/3/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jackjin1997/TentOfTrials/issues/3","id":4698751554,"node_id":"I_kwDOS8rlmM8AAAABGBFCQg","number":3,"title":"[$30 BOUNTY] [Python] Add build diagnostic metadata tests","user":{"login":"jackjin1997","id":28055621,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MDU1NjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28055621?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackjin1997","html_url":"https://github.com/jackjin1997","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackjin1997/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackjin1997/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackjin1997/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackjin1997/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackjin1997/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackjin1997/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackjin1997/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackjin1997/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackjin1997/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11254524640,"node_id":"LA_kwDOS8rlmM8AAAACntJq4A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jackjin1997/TentOfTrials/labels/help%20wanted","name":"help wanted","color":"008672","default":true,"description":"Open for external contribution"},{"id":11254524649,"node_id":"LA_kwDOS8rlmM8AAAACntJq6Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jackjin1997/TentOfTrials/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for first-time contributors"},{"id":11277785022,"node_id":"LA_kwDOS8rlmM8AAAACoDVXvg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jackjin1997/TentOfTrials/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Bounty issue"},{"id":11277800532,"node_id":"LA_kwDOS8rlmM8AAAACoDWUVA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jackjin1997/TentOfTrials/labels/language:python","name":"language:python","color":"3572A5","default":false,"description":"Python language task"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2026-06-19T07:22:17Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T03:33:59Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Bounty:** $30 (LT)\n\n**Area:** `build.py`\n\n**Current state:** The build script writes diagnostic JSON metadata and encrypted `.logd` artifacts that gate PR review, but the metadata shape and logd reference behavior are not protected by focused regression tests.\n\n**What is needed:** Add tests for diagnostic report generation so future build.py changes cannot break the JSON/logd contract expected by the GitHub diagnostic check.\n\n**Acceptance criteria:**\n- Cover successful report metadata including commit id, module result summaries, and `diagnostic_logd` path.\n- Cover logd generation failure populating `diagnostic_logd_error` without claiming a valid archive.\n- Cover chunked or multi-file logd references if the script emits split artifacts.\n- Keep tests deterministic and avoid requiring external toolchains or network access.\n- Document the local command for running the new tests.\n\n**Required validation:**\n- Run the new Python test command, for example `python3 -m pytest -q` if pytest is used.\n- Run `python3 build.py`.\n- Include the generated `diagnostic/build-*.logd` artifact from `diagnostic/`; include the matching `diagnostic/build-*.json` if present.\n- Use `.github/pull_request_template.md` for the submission.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jackjin1997/TentOfTrials/issues/3/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jackjin1997/TentOfTrials/issues/3/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782","id":4195435600,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa876EURQ","number":2782,"title":"[ONBOARD: 1 RTC] Review an Open PR","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10360962887,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaY-_Rw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/onboarding","name":"onboarding","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1358,"created_at":"2026-04-02T15:41:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T03:16:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 2 RTC\n\n### What You'll Do\nHelp us review code. Every PR benefits from a second pair of eyes.\n\n### Steps\n1. **Pick any open PR** from [Rustchain](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/pulls), [BoTTube](https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube/pulls), or [rustchain-bounties](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/pulls)\n2. **Read the code changes** (click \"Files changed\" tab)\n3. **Leave a substantive review comment**. Examples:\n   - \"Line 42: this SQL query isn't parameterized, potential injection\"\n   - \"This function duplicates logic already in utils.py line 80\"\n   - \"Missing error handling if the API returns non-200\"\n   - \"Good approach, but the variable name should describe what it holds\"\n4. **Comment here** with a link to your review\n\n### What Counts\n- Review must be **technical and specific** (not \"looks good\" or \"nice work\")\n- Point to specific lines with specific observations\n- Positive observations count too (\"good use of context manager here\")\n- You don't need to be an expert. Asking good questions is reviewing.\n\n### Payment\n2 RTC once your review contains at least 2 substantive observations.\n\n**Difficulty**: Easy-Medium | **Time**: 20-40 min | **Skills**: Can read Python or JavaScript\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/reactions","total_count":12,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":3,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71","id":3904303864,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87otvL4","number":71,"title":"[BOUNTY] Ongoing Bug Bounty Program — Find Bugs, Earn RTC (133 RTC Pool)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029408,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZoA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":432,"created_at":"2026-02-06T01:13:53Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:47:44Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Ongoing Bug Bounty Program\n\n**Pool: 750 RTC (ongoing, replenished as needed)**\n\n### Severity & Rewards\n| Severity | Description | Reward |\n|----------|-------------|--------|\n| **Critical** | Fund theft, consensus bypass, RCE | 100-200 RTC |\n| **High** | Data leak, auth bypass, significant logic error | 50-100 RTC |\n| **Medium** | DoS, info disclosure, moderate bugs | 15-50 RTC |\n| **Low** | UI bugs, minor leaks, doc errors | 5-15 RTC |\n\n### In-Scope\n- RustChain node software, attestation & fingerprint system\n- Epoch settlement & rewards, wallet endpoints\n- BoTTube web app, API, payment system\n- Python SDK, Block Explorer, Wallet GUI, Miner clients\n\n### Reporting\n1. Create GitHub issue with `[SECURITY]` prefix\n2. For critical: email first, issue after fix\n3. Include: steps to reproduce, impact, suggested fix\n\n### Rules\n- First reporter wins\n- Responsible disclosure required\n- Must not exploit on production\n\n---\n*Total RTC supply: 8.3M | RTC Reference Rate: 1 RTC = $0.10 USD*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":3,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/71/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2156","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2156/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2156/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2156/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2156","id":4084033846,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87zbWk2","number":2156,"title":"[BOUNTY: 10 RTC] BoTTube — Video Page Customization","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":42,"created_at":"2026-03-16T18:15:08Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:37:11Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 15 RTC\n\n### Task\nImplement the feature described in **Scottcjn/bottube#422**.\n\n### How to claim\n1. Read the full spec: https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/422\n2. Open a PR on [Scottcjn/bottube](https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube) implementing the feature\n3. Comment here with your PR link and wallet address\n4. Partial implementations welcome — bounty scales with scope delivered\n\n### Context\nThese features address real user feedback from [ToolPilot.ai reviews](https://www.toolpilot.ai/products/bottube-1) (currently 86% positive, 7 reviews). We're turning 4-star feedback into 5-star features.\n\n**RTC Value: 15 RTC (~$15.00 at $0.10/RTC reference)**","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2156/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2156/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/455","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/455/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/455/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/455/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/455","id":4002331192,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87ujro4","number":455,"title":"[25 RTC] Dual-Mining: Ergo (Autolykos2) Integration","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":14,"created_at":"2026-02-27T18:34:38Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:35:10Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Ergo Dual-Mining Integration — 25 RTC\n\n**Mine Ergo + earn RTC for free.** RIP-PoA attestation costs zero compute.\n\n### What to Build\n\nImplement and test the Ergo-specific proof path in `clawrtc/data/pow_miners.py`:\n\n1. **Node RPC proof** (1.5x bonus): Query local Ergo node at `localhost:9053/info` — verify `isMining: true`, extract chain height, peer count, best block hash\n2. **Pool account proof** (1.3x bonus): Verify hashrate via HeroMiners, WoolyPooly, Nanopool, or 2miners API\n3. **Server validation**: Add Ergo-specific validation in `validate_pow_proof()` on the RustChain node\n\n### Ergo Node API Reference\n- `GET /info` — node status, mining flag, height\n- `GET /mining/candidate` — current mining candidate (proves active mining)\n- Default port: 9053 (mainnet), 9052 (testnet)\n\n### Testing\n- Run an Ergo node with mining enabled\n- Run `clawrtc mine --pow ergo`\n- Verify proof is generated and accepted by RustChain node\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Ergo node auto-detected by port + process\n- [ ] Node RPC proof includes chain height + mining status\n- [ ] Pool verification works for at least 2 pools\n- [ ] Nonce binding prevents proof replay\n- [ ] Unit tests pass\n\nSee master issue: #453","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/455/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/455/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/458","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/458/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/458/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/458/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/458","id":4002331744,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87ujrxg","number":458,"title":"[25 RTC] Dual-Mining: Monero (RandomX) Integration","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":18,"created_at":"2026-02-27T18:34:43Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:35:10Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Monero Dual-Mining Integration — 25 RTC\n\n**Mine XMR + earn RTC for free.** RandomX is CPU-optimized.\n\n### What to Build\n\n1. **Node RPC proof** (1.5x bonus): Query monerod at `localhost:18081/json_rpc`\n2. **P2Pool proof**: Query local P2Pool at `localhost:18083/local/stats`\n3. **Pool account proof** (1.3x bonus): Verify via HeroMiners or Nanopool\n4. **Process detection**: Detect `xmrig`, `monerod`, `p2pool`, `xmr-stak`\n\n### XMR API Reference\n- `POST /json_rpc` with `{\"method\": \"get_info\"}` — height, difficulty, tx pool\n- Default ports: 18081 (RPC), 18082 (restricted), 18083 (P2Pool)\n\n### Why Monero Miners Love This\nXMRig uses 100% of CPU for RandomX hashing. RIP-PoA runs during attestation windows (5 sec every 10 min) — negligible impact.\n\nSee master issue: #453","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/458/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/458/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453","id":4001999654,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87uiasm","number":453,"title":"[50 RTC] Dual-Mining Integration: Earn RTC While Mining PoW Coins","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":26,"created_at":"2026-02-27T17:08:00Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:34:18Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Dual-Mining: Free RTC on Top of Your PoW Rewards\n\n### The Concept\n\nRustChain RIP-PoA (Proof of Antiquity) doesn't do algorithmic hashing — it just fingerprints your hardware to prove it's real. **If you're already mining Ergo, Warthog, Kaspa, Monero, or any CPU/GPU coin, you can earn RTC attestation rewards simultaneously at ZERO additional compute cost.**\n\nYour PoW miner keeps 100% of CPU/GPU for hashing. RTC is literally free money on top.\n\n### How It Works\n\n1. Run your normal PoW miner (xmrig, ergo node, wart-miner, etc.)\n2. Also run `clawrtc mine --pow` alongside it\n3. clawrtc auto-detects your running miner and generates a proof\n4. The proof gets submitted with your hardware attestation\n5. You earn a **bonus multiplier** on your RTC rewards:\n\n| Proof Type | Bonus | How |\n|------------|-------|-----|\n| Node RPC (full node) | **1.5x** | clawrtc queries your local node |\n| Pool account (verified) | **1.3x** | clawrtc checks pool API |\n| Process detection | **1.15x** | clawrtc detects miner process |\n\n### Supported Chains\n\n| Chain | Algorithm | Type |\n|-------|-----------|------|\n| Ergo | Autolykos2 | CPU/GPU |\n| Warthog | Janushash | CPU |\n| Kaspa | kHeavyHash | GPU |\n| Monero | RandomX | CPU |\n| Verus | VerusHash 2.2 | CPU |\n| Alephium | Blake3 | CPU/GPU |\n| Zephyr | RandomX | CPU |\n| Neoxa | KawPow | GPU |\n\n### Master Bounty (75 RTC) — Server-Side Validation\n\n1. Add `pow_mining_proofs` table to RustChain node DB\n2. Add `validate_pow_proof()` to `/attest/submit` endpoint\n3. Integrate PoW bonus into reward calculation\n4. Anti-cheat: nonce binding, proof expiration, rate limiting\n5. Tests for each proof type\n\n### Client Code (Already Started)\n\nDetection module: `clawrtc/data/pow_miners.py` — auto-detects 8 PoW chains.\n\n```bash\npip install clawrtc\npython -c \"from clawrtc.data.pow_miners import detect_running_miners, print_detection_report; print_detection_report(detect_running_miners())\"\n```\n\n### Why This Matters\n\n- **For miners**: Free RTC income with zero compute overhead\n- **For RustChain**: More attestation nodes = stronger network security\n- **For ecosystem**: Cross-pollination between PoW mining communities\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/453/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2161","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2161/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2161/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2161/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2161","id":4084034331,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87zbWsb","number":2161,"title":"[BOUNTY: 17 RTC] BoTTube — Creator Collaboration Features","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":53,"created_at":"2026-03-16T18:15:15Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:33:02Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 25 RTC\n\n### Task\nImplement the feature described in **Scottcjn/bottube#427**.\n\n### How to claim\n1. Read the full spec: https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube/issues/427\n2. Open a PR on [Scottcjn/bottube](https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube) implementing the feature\n3. Comment here with your PR link and wallet address\n4. Partial implementations welcome — bounty scales with scope delivered\n\n### Context\nThese features address real user feedback from [ToolPilot.ai reviews](https://www.toolpilot.ai/products/bottube-1) (currently 86% positive, 7 reviews). We're turning 4-star feedback into 5-star features.\n\n**RTC Value: 25 RTC (~$25.00 at $0.10/RTC reference)**","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2161/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2161/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68","id":3904274603,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87otoCr","number":68,"title":"[BOUNTY] 🔴 Red Team: Block Explorer & Dashboard Hardening (50 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035877,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy5Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/open","name":"open","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Open for claims"},{"id":10119173301,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZUtQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/red-team","name":"red-team","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"Adversarial security testing"},{"id":10119173491,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWyZVcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/hardening","name":"hardening","color":"0052CC","default":false,"description":"Security improvements"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":35,"created_at":"2026-02-06T01:03:43Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:18:59Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Red Team Bounty: Block Explorer Security\n\n**Reward: 75 RTC** (~$7.50 at reference rate)\n\n### Target\nThe Block Explorer and Hardware Museum merged in Rustchain PR #4 by @erdogan98.\n\n**Code location:** `explorer/` directory (index.html, museum.html — 1022 lines)\n\n### What to Attack\n\n1. **Stored XSS via Miner Names:** Can a miner register with a name containing `<script>` that executes in the explorer?\n2. **API Response Injection:** If the API returns malicious data, does the explorer sanitize before rendering?\n3. **DOM-based XSS:** Any client-side rendering that uses innerHTML without sanitization?\n4. **Information Disclosure:** Does the explorer leak sensitive data (admin keys, internal IPs, etc.)?\n5. **Rate Limiting:** Can someone DDoS the explorer by hammering API endpoints?\n6. **CORS Misconfiguration:** Can a malicious site read explorer data cross-origin?\n\n### Deliverables\n- Security report with severity ratings\n- PoC for each finding\n- Patched HTML files (bonus RTC)\n\n### Claiming\nComment below.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/68/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2819","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2819/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2819/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2819/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2819","id":4203177266,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa876h2Uy","number":2819,"title":"[BOUNTY] Red Team UTXO Implementation — Find Bugs, Earn RTC (33-133 RTC)","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029422,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZrg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/help%20wanted","name":"help wanted","color":"008672","default":true,"description":"Extra attention is needed"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10334947395,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaALIQw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/security","name":"security","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":176,"created_at":"2026-04-04T03:03:17Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T01:44:51Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Overview\n\nRustChain is migrating from an account-based balance model to a full UTXO (Unspent Transaction Output) model. **Phase 1+2 just landed** in [`39bf02b`](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/commit/39bf02b).\n\nWe want adversarial eyes on this before enabling dual-write on production. Break it, get paid.\n\n## Files to Review\n\nAll in the [`node/`](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/tree/main/node) directory of the main Rustchain repo:\n\n| File | Lines | Purpose |\n|------|-------|---------|\n| `utxo_db.py` | ~708 | Core UTXO database layer — UTXOs, transactions, mempool, Merkle roots, coin selection |\n| `test_utxo_db.py` | ~421 | 29 unit tests covering the UTXO layer |\n| `utxo_genesis_migration.py` | ~272 | Deterministic migration of 538 existing account balances into genesis UTXOs |\n| `rustchain_v2_integrated_v2.2.1_rip200.py` | (diff) | Server integration — imports + table init behind `UTXO_DUAL_WRITE` feature flag |\n\n## What to Look For\n\n### Critical Vectors (200 RTC)\n- **Double-spend attacks** — Can the same UTXO be consumed twice? Race conditions in `apply_transaction()`?\n- **Fund creation from nothing** — Can a transaction create more RTC in outputs than exists in inputs?\n- **Genesis migration tampering** — Can the migration be re-run to duplicate balances?\n\n### High Severity (100 RTC)\n- **Race conditions** — Concurrent transaction application, TOCTOU between validation and commitment\n- **Conservation law bypass** — Any path where `sum(inputs) != sum(outputs) + fee`\n- **Lock/unlock logic errors** — Can locked UTXOs be spent? Can spending bypass the lock check?\n\n### Medium Severity (50 RTC)\n- **Mempool DoS** — Can the mempool be flooded or manipulated to block legitimate transactions?\n- **Merkle state root manipulation** — Can the state root be made to diverge between nodes?\n- **Fee calculation exploits** — Negative fees, integer overflow in fee math, fee-free transactions that should require fees\n\n### Low Severity (25 RTC)\n- **Coin selection edge cases** — Pathological wallet states that break coin selection\n- **Code quality issues** — SQL injection vectors, unchecked error paths, missing validations\n- **Test coverage gaps** — Important scenarios not covered by the 29 existing tests\n\n## How to Submit\n\n**Option A (preferred):** Open a PR on [Scottcjn/Rustchain](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain) with a **failing test case** that demonstrates the bug. Title it `[UTXO-BUG] <description>`.\n\n**Option B:** Open an issue on this repo with a detailed writeup including:\n1. The vulnerability class\n2. Steps to reproduce\n3. Expected vs actual behavior\n4. Suggested fix (optional but earns bonus)\n\n## Bounty Tiers Summary\n\n| Severity | Payout | Examples |\n|----------|--------|----------|\n| **Critical** | **200 RTC** | Double-spend, fund creation, genesis duplication |\n| **High** | **100 RTC** | Race conditions, conservation bypass |\n| **Medium** | **50 RTC** | Mempool DoS, Merkle manipulation |\n| **Low** | **25 RTC** | Edge cases, code quality, test gaps |\n\nMultiple valid findings from the same researcher will each be paid individually.\n\n## Context\n\n- RTC reference rate: **1 RTC = $0.10 USD**\n- The UTXO layer is behind a feature flag (`UTXO_DUAL_WRITE=0` by default) — it is NOT active on the live network yet\n- The existing account-based model continues to handle all production transactions\n- This is a pre-production security review before we flip the switch\n\n## Resources\n\n- [RustChain Node Health](https://50.28.86.131/health)\n- [Block Explorer](https://50.28.86.131/explorer)\n- [Active Miners API](https://50.28.86.131/api/miners)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2819/reactions","total_count":15,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":5,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2819/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/747","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/747/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/747/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/747/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/747","id":4037177278,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wom--","number":747,"title":"[BOUNTY: 50-75 RTC] Bounty Verification Bot — Auto-Verify Star/Follow Claims","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10115035932,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWuczHA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/major","name":"major","color":"F9D0C4","default":false,"description":"50-200 RTC"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"},{"id":10356027005,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaURufQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/development","name":"development","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":202,"created_at":"2026-03-07T03:24:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T01:43:27Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty Verification Bot\n\nWe spend hours every session manually checking star counts, follow status, wallet existence, and article links. A bot that auto-verifies claims would save massive time.\n\n### What to Build\n\nA GitHub Action or bot that monitors bounty issue comments, detects claims, and posts automated verification results.\n\n### Payout\n\n| Milestone | Reward |\n|-----------|--------|\n| Star/follow verification (reads comment, checks GitHub API, posts result) | **30 RTC** |\n| Wallet existence check (queries RustChain node API) | **+10 RTC** |\n| Article/URL verification (checks dev.to/Medium links are live) | **+10 RTC** |\n| Dev.to article word count + quality check | **+10 RTC** |\n| Duplicate claim detection (checks if user already claimed) | **+15 RTC** |\n\n### How It Should Work\n\n1. **Triggered by**: New comment on bounty issues containing keywords like \"Claiming\", \"Wallet:\", \"Stars:\", \"GitHub:\"\n2. **Checks performed**:\n   - Does user follow @Scottcjn? (`GET /users/{user}/following/Scottcjn` → 204 = yes)\n   - How many Scottcjn repos has user starred? (paginate `/users/{user}/starred`)\n   - Does the claimed wallet exist? (`GET https://50.28.86.131/wallet/balance?miner_id={wallet}`)\n   - Is the claimed article URL live? (HEAD request, check 200)\n   - Has this user already been paid? (check for \"PAID\" in previous comments)\n3. **Posts a verification comment**:\n```\n## Automated Verification for @username\n\n| Check | Result |\n|-------|--------|\n| Follows @Scottcjn | ✅ Yes |\n| Scottcjn repos starred | 45 |\n| Wallet `my-wallet` exists | ✅ Balance: 10.5 RTC |\n| Article link | ✅ Live (dev.to, 612 words) |\n| Previous claims | ⚠️ Paid 25 RTC on #665 |\n\n**Suggested payout**: 45 stars × 1.0 RTC (follows + 45+ multiplier) = 45 RTC\n```\n\n### Technical Requirements\n\n1. **GitHub Action** (preferred) — runs on `issue_comment` webhook\n2. **Secrets needed**: `GITHUB_TOKEN` (for API), `RUSTCHAIN_NODE_URL`\n3. **Rate limit aware** — GitHub API has limits, batch requests efficiently\n4. **No payment execution** — bot ONLY verifies, human approves payment\n5. **Configurable** — bounty rules (rate per star, follow multiplier) in a config file\n6. **Open source** on GitHub\n\n### Why This Matters\n\nManual verification takes 2-5 minutes per claim. With 20+ claims per session, that's over an hour of repetitive API checking. The bot does it in seconds and never makes math errors.\n\nThe human (Scott) still decides whether to pay — the bot just eliminates the grunt work.\n\n### Submit As\n\nStandalone repo with GitHub Action workflow, or PR to a new `Scottcjn/bounty-bot` repo.\n\n**Wallet:** Include your wallet address when claiming.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/747/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/747/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/755","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/755/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/755/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/755/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/755","id":4037177391,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wonAv","number":755,"title":"[BOUNTY: 10 RTC] Automated Backup Verification — Validate RustChain DB Backups","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10356027005,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaURufQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/development","name":"development","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":27,"created_at":"2026-03-07T03:24:28Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T01:41:47Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Automated Backup Verification\n\nThe node backs up the SQLite DB, but nobody verifies the backups are valid. A script that tests backup integrity prevents silent data loss.\n\n### Payout\n\n**10 RTC** for a working verification script.\n\n### What to Build\n\nA script that:\n\n1. Finds the latest backup file (`rustchain_v2.db.bak` or similar)\n2. Copies it to a temp location\n3. Runs SQLite integrity check: `PRAGMA integrity_check;`\n4. Verifies key tables exist and have data:\n   - `balances` — has rows with positive amounts\n   - `miner_attest_recent` — has recent attestations\n   - `headers` — has block headers\n   - `ledger` — has transactions\n   - `epoch_rewards` — has reward records\n5. Compares row counts against the live DB (backup shouldn't be more than 1 epoch behind)\n6. Reports PASS/FAIL with details\n7. Optionally alerts on failure (email, webhook, or just exit code)\n\n### Usage\n\n```bash\n# Run as cron job daily\n0 6 * * * /root/rustchain/verify_backup.sh >> /var/log/backup_verify.log 2>&1\n\n# Output:\n# [2026-03-07 06:00:01] Backup: /root/rustchain/backups/rustchain_v2_20260307.db\n# [2026-03-07 06:00:02] Integrity: PASS\n# [2026-03-07 06:00:02] balances: 282 rows (live: 282) ✅\n# [2026-03-07 06:00:02] miner_attest_recent: 18 rows (live: 18) ✅\n# [2026-03-07 06:00:02] headers: 13680 rows (live: 13680) ✅\n# [2026-03-07 06:00:02] RESULT: PASS\n```\n\n### Technical Requirements\n\n1. **Bash or Python** script\n2. **Non-destructive** — never modifies the backup or live DB\n3. **Works on the VPS** — Ubuntu, SQLite3 installed\n4. **Exit code**: 0 = pass, 1 = fail (for cron alerting)\n5. **Handles missing backup gracefully** (reports, doesn't crash)\n\n### Submit As\n\nPR to [Scottcjn/Rustchain](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain) or [Scottcjn/rustchain-monitor](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-monitor).\n\n**Wallet:** Include your wallet address when claiming.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/755/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/755/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/751","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/751/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/751/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/751/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/751","id":4037177331,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wom_z","number":751,"title":"[BOUNTY: 7-10 RTC] RustChain Testnet Faucet — Free Test RTC for Developers","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"},{"id":10356027005,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaURufQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/development","name":"development","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":20,"created_at":"2026-03-07T03:24:25Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T01:41:18Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Testnet Faucet\n\nDevelopers building SDKs and tools need test RTC to try transfers without mining or earning. A faucet removes that barrier.\n\n### Payout\n\n| Milestone | Reward |\n|-----------|--------|\n| Working faucet web page + API | **10 RTC** |\n| GitHub OAuth verification (prevent abuse) | **+5 RTC** |\n\n### What to Build\n\nA simple web page at `https://50.28.86.131/faucet` (or standalone):\n\n1. User enters their RTC wallet address\n2. Optionally authenticates with GitHub\n3. Receives **1 test RTC** per request\n4. Rate limited: 1 request per GitHub account per 24 hours\n\n### API Endpoint\n\n```\nPOST /faucet/drip\n{\n  \"wallet\": \"my-test-wallet\",\n  \"github_username\": \"myuser\"  // optional but increases limit\n}\n\nResponse:\n{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"amount\": 1.0,\n  \"pending_id\": 123,\n  \"next_available\": \"2026-03-08T12:00:00Z\"\n}\n```\n\n### Rate Limiting\n\n| Auth Method | Limit |\n|-------------|-------|\n| No auth (IP only) | 0.5 RTC per 24h |\n| GitHub OAuth | 1.0 RTC per 24h |\n| GitHub account > 1 year old | 2.0 RTC per 24h |\n\n### Technical Requirements\n\n1. **Flask route** on the RustChain node (or standalone service)\n2. **SQLite tracking** — who got what, when, from which IP\n3. **Uses admin transfer API** internally (with a dedicated `faucet_pool` wallet)\n4. **Anti-abuse**: rate limiting, GitHub account age check, IP tracking\n5. **Simple HTML form** — no framework needed\n\n### Submit As\n\nPR to [Scottcjn/Rustchain](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain) or standalone repo.\n\n**Wallet:** Include your wallet address when claiming.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/751/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/751/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/7","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/7/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/7/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/7/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/7","id":271788800,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyNzE3ODg4MDA=","number":7,"title":"New daily trending repos in Python","user":{"login":"vitalets","id":1473072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NzMwNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1473072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets","html_url":"https://github.com/vitalets","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":737629106,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3Mzc2MjkxMDY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos/labels/trending-daily","name":"trending-daily","color":"cc317c","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":31,"created_at":"2017-11-07T10:54:34Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T00:08:33Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Subscribe to this issue and stay notified about new [daily trending repos in Python](https://github.com/trending/python?since=daily)!","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/7/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/7/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398","id":3974807149,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87s6r5t","number":398,"title":"[QUEST] Harden the Chain — Security Quest, 67 RTC Total","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":65,"created_at":"2026-02-22T15:25:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T19:04:22Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Quest Chain: Harden the Chain\n\nFor security-minded contributors. Complete each step to earn up to **100 RTC** and the **Guardian** title.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Read the Architecture (10 RTC)\nRead the codebase and write a 500+ word security assessment covering:\n- How attestation works (the \\`/attest/submit\\` flow)\n- How hardware fingerprinting prevents VM farms\n- How epoch rewards are calculated and distributed\n- One potential attack vector you identified\n\n**Prove it:** Post your assessment as a comment or gist link.\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Reproduce a Known Fix (15 RTC)\nPick one vulnerability from BuilderFred's audit (all 6 are fixed):\n1. VM Fingerprint Bypass\n2. Antiquity Spoofing\n3. Mock Signature Mode\n4. Inline PubKey Hijack\n5. SQL Schema Mismatch\n6. Hardware Binding Bypass\n\nSet up a local test environment and demonstrate you understand HOW the fix works by:\n- Describing the attack before the fix\n- Showing the fix in the code\n- Explaining why the fix is sufficient (or isn't)\n\n**Prove it:** Write-up with code references.\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Find Something New (75 RTC)\nFind and report a previously unknown security issue. Must include:\n- Clear description of the vulnerability\n- Steps to reproduce\n- Severity assessment (Critical/High/Medium/Low)\n- Suggested fix\n\n**Prove it:** File a responsible disclosure via the SECURITY.md process. If confirmed, earn the full 75 RTC + Guardian title.\n\n---\n\n### Completion\n\n| Steps | Reward | Title |\n|-------|--------|-------|\n| Step 1 only | 10 RTC | Security Explorer |\n| Steps 1 + 2 | 25 RTC | Security Analyst |\n| Steps 1 + 2 + 3 | **100 RTC** | **Guardian** |\n\n*You don't have to find a new vulnerability to earn from Steps 1 and 2. Those reward understanding, not just discovery.*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/398/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/priyanshudumps/fuel-agent-kit/issues/1","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/priyanshudumps/fuel-agent-kit","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/priyanshudumps/fuel-agent-kit/issues/1/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/priyanshudumps/fuel-agent-kit/issues/1/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/priyanshudumps/fuel-agent-kit/issues/1/events","html_url":"https://github.com/priyanshudumps/fuel-agent-kit/issues/1","id":4252965132,"node_id":"I_kwDOPc9Jp879fxkM","number":1,"title":"add a python version of the kit","user":{"login":"priyanshudumps","id":117640363,"node_id":"U_kgDOBwMMqw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117640363?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/priyanshudumps","html_url":"https://github.com/priyanshudumps","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/priyanshudumps/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/priyanshudumps/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/priyanshudumps/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/priyanshudumps/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/priyanshudumps/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/priyanshudumps/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/priyanshudumps/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/priyanshudumps/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/priyanshudumps/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10679807504,"node_id":"LA_kwDOPc9Jp88AAAACfJDuEA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/priyanshudumps/fuel-agent-kit/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"f59e0b","default":false,"d