georgatos","id":1531968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MzE5Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1531968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgeorgatos","html_url":"https://github.com/fgeorgatos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgeorgatos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgeorgatos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgeorgatos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgeorgatos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgeorgatos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgeorgatos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgeorgatos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgeorgatos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgeorgatos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Now that the test gates are in place, let's get things in good order:\n\n* [ ] `./qtop -d` or `./qtop -bb` and other funny cli invocations welcome you with a stack trace, which is not too legible - let’s improve\n* [ ] Reduce __init__.py files where/if possible or find a way to contain troubles thereof\n* [ ] `grep -R FIXME`, too many issues come up: fix at least a handful even if trivial\n* [ ] Drop references to `SimpleNamespace`? reduce further imports, if possible? (with no LOC explosion...)\n* [ ] handle all `depandabot` feedback https://github.com/qtop/qtop/security/dependabot\n* [ ] fix all error/warnings and at least 5 notes from: https://github.com/qtop/qtop/security/quality\n* [ ] AOB that regards code quality and readability aspects - stylistic propositions welcome if they fall in the readability class\n* [ ] (main body of) improve any QA topic as per https://github.com/qtop/qtop/pull/457#issuecomment-4614863794\n* [ ] include #502 - cherrypick or simply copy\n* [ ] #400 & #351: these are correct PRs, but we had no way to test them (read: windows), include one of and show result\n* [ ] show at least one successful *coloured* run per batch scheduler in the comments of your PR (i.e. x5) \n\nHints: Align to contributing.md, declare PoH; read: no PoH or not aligned => no review => NO BOUNTY.\nRequirement https://github.com/qtop/qtop/issues/1: On the day of agreement with contributing.md prefix the PR subject with a dated tag (20260101 etc)\nRequirement https://github.com/qtop/qtop/issues/2: NO FORCE PUSHING INSIDE PRs. AT ALL TIMES. ASK PERMISSION AND GIVE WHY IF UNAVOIDABLE.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qtop/qtop/issues/484/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/qtop/qtop/issues/484/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/37","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/37/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/37/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/37/events","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/37","id":4773646524,"node_id":"I_kwDOTGNm188AAAABHIgQvA","number":37,"title":"[BUG] CORS Misconfiguration — $10","user":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber","id":288065324,"node_id":"U_kgDOESuHLA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/288065324?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https: