 fix code in a comment below (use code blocks)\n2. AI evaluation system will automatically assess your submission\n3. If passed, bounty is awarded and leaderboard is updated\n\n### Rules\n- Python or JavaScript accepted\n- No hardcoded expected results\n- All participants can submit — everyone who passes gets the bounty","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/33/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/33/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/11","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/11/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/11/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/11/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vitalets/github-trending-repos/issues/11","id":271791306,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyNzE3OTEzMDY=","number":11,"title":"New weekly trending repos in Python","user":{"login":"vitalets","id":1473072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NzMwNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1473072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets","html_url":"https://github.com/vitalets","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitalets/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vita