ounty: Performance Enhancer","user":{"login":"Dragoon4002","id":108277454,"node_id":"U_kgDOBnQuzg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108277454?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dragoon4002","html_url":"https://github.com/Dragoon4002","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dragoon4002/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dragoon4002/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dragoon4002/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dragoon4002/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dragoon4002/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dragoon4002/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dragoon4002/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dragoon4002/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dragoon4002/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":22,"created_at":"2026-06-28T17:19:15Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T21:33:17Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Overview\nReward pool: **50 USDC** distributed among contributors who submit performance improvements. (It is an Issue tester for another project, but current issuer will be rewarded once the assesment is made correctly)\n\n## What qualifies\n- Profiling results identifying bottlenecks\n- Code optimizations (rendering, API, DB queries, bundle size)\n- Caching strategies with measurable impact\n- Benchmark comparisons (before/after)\n\n## How to submit\nOpen a PR referencing this issue. Include what you changed and why it's faster.\n\n## Reward distribution\nTop contributions share the pool based on impact:\n- Best overall: 20 USDC\n- Runner-up: 10 USDC\n- 3rd place: 5 USDC\n- Honorable mentions (up to 15): 1 USDC each\n\n## Judging\nRepo maintainer reviews all PRs, ranks by measurable improvement, distributes accordingly.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dragoon4002/artic-trader/issues/2/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dragoon4002/artic-trader/issues/2/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UnsafeLabs/Bounty-Hunters/issues/797","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UnsafeLabs/Bounty-Hunters","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UnsafeLabs/Bounty-Hunters/issues/797/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UnsafeLabs/Bounty-Hunters/issues/797/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UnsafeLabs/Bounty-Hunters/issues/797/events","html_url":"https://github.com/UnsafeLabs/Bounty-Hunters/issues/797","id":4452023744,"node_id":"I_kwDOScC6ZM8AAAABCVx9wA","number":797,"title":"[ FastAPI ] Add request ID middleware for log correlation","user":{"login":"clankerjournalist","id":185875308,"node_id":"U_kgDOCxQ7bA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185875308?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clankerjournalist","html_url":"https://github.com/clankerjournalist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clankerjournalist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clankerjournalist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clankerjournalist/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clankerjournalist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clankerjournalist/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clankerjournalist/